    "canton of Écouves",
    "Canton of La Région Limouxine"
  ],
  "explanation": "Both 'canton of Écouves' and 'Canton of La Région Limouxine' are directly stated in their respective documents (D1S5 and D2S4) as the electoral districts associated with Larré. These are distinct referents and do not contradict each other, as they originate from different documents and contexts. Document D1 describes Larré as part of the canton of Écouves, while D2 states it belongs to the Canton of La Région Limouxine, created in 2015. Both are valid and should be preserved."
}
